<section>
    <h2 class="page-heading">Installation</h2>

    <p>
        <b>Note: </b> It is a requirement that the Blazor Ramp Core <span class="code-span">core-live-region.js</span> script, <span class="code-span">LiveRegionService</span>, and
        associated <span class="code-span">&lt;AnnouncementHistory /&gt;</span> component are added alongside this component’s specific
        requirements (a stylesheet reference in this instance). You do not need to add the BlazorRamp.Core package separately, as BlazorRamp.Core is included as a transitive package, you only need to add the packages that contain the components
        that you wish to use i.e the <b>BlazorRamp.ToggleTip</b> NuGet package.
    </p>
    <p>
        Please follow the instructions in the <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Class" href="@GlobalValues.Path_Overview_Getting_Started">@GlobalValues.Main_Nav_Section_Heading_About - @GlobalValues.Page_Heading_Overview_Getting_Started</a>
        ensuring that in the <span class="code-span">&lt;head&gt;</span> section you also add the Switch stylesheet as follows:
    </p>
    <CodeBox CodeBlock="@CodeSnippets.Add_ToggleTip_Style_Sheet" AriaLabel="Add toggleitp stylesheet code block" />

</section>

<section class="code-table">

    <h2 id="toggle-tip-component-parameters" class="code-table__heading">Toggletip component parameters</h2>

    <table aria-labelledby="toggle-tip-component-parameters">

        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th scope="col">Parameter</th>
                <th scope="col">Type</th>
                <th scope="col">Description</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>Label</td>
                <td>string</td>
                <td>Text shown next to the icon button and is used as an aria-label for the icon button when not shown. 
                    Defaults to "supplemental information" if not entered.
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>CloseText</td>
                <td>string</td>
                <td>Text shown on the optional close button. Defaults to "Close" if not entered.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>ShowLabel</td>
                <td>bool</td>
                <td>Removes the label and reclaims its space when set to false. Defaults to true.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>ShowClose</td>
                <td>bool</td>
                <td>Removes the button and reclaims its space when set to false. Defaults to true.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>ToggleTipLabelOrder</td>
                <td>ToggleTipLabelOrder (enum)</td>
                <td>Value that determines whether the label is to the left or right of the icon. Defaults to <span class="code-span">ToggleTipLabelOrder.LabelFirst</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>ToggleTipPosition</td>
                <td>ToggleTipPosition (enum)</td>
                <td>Value that determins the position of the toggletip popover in relation to the icon button. Defaults to <span class="code-span">ToggleTipPosition.TopCentre</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>ToggleTipSize</td>
                <td>ToggleTipSize (enum)</td>
                <td>Determines the size of the toggletip popover. Defaults to <span class="code-span">ToggleTipSize.Small</span>. See note below.</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>
        <b>Note: </b>The size sets the maximum widths and heights in viewport units with all sharing the fixed minimums of 320px for width (W) and 300px for height (H).
        Like everything these can be changed if necessary. The defaults for small are W:30vw H:40vh, medium W:40vw H:50vh and large W:50vw H:60vh. 
    </p>
</section>
